    "description": {
      "value": "You supercool the nearby air, forming a cloud of dancing ice crystals in an emanation around you. A creature other than you that enters the area or ends its turn within the area takes 2d6 cold damage. A creature can take this damage only once per turn. The crystals scatter and refract light; if a light effect enters diamond dust's area, any creatures that effect goes on to affect gain a +2 status bonus to AC and saves against it.\n\nWhile the spell persists, you can activate or deactivate this aura by using a single action, which has the concentrate trait.\n\nYou can Dismiss this spell."
    },
    "higher_level_description": {
      "value": "Heightened (+2): The damage increases by 1d6."
    },
